kew:** It is flat, so you aren't paying extra for downside or upside strikes.\n\nPricing alone gives no edge, so whether to buy depends on your view of the stock. The one concentration risk I found is in the customer mix. Utilities are 62% of VLTX holdings' orders, Pellham Power is 35% of those utility orders, and Norvane is 21%. A loss of one of those customers would hit the stock hard. At 27% implied vol, the market may not fully price that in, but this data can't confirm it.\n\nI only had the LEAPS snapshot, the customer mix and a three-point yearly IV history. I didn't have the underlying price, strikes, premiums, or the stock's realized volatility. Comparing implied to realized volatility would be the next check.","ttft_ms":5066,"type":"result","duration_ms":21547,"uuid":"c4dd437c-f415-425e-9006-65d6a94a9e9b","ttft_stream_ms":4406,"time_to_request_ms":156,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":15,"system_prompt":5,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":6,"input_attachments":32,"input_hooks":6,"conversation_append":3,"transcript_persist":13,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":11,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":3,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":5,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":4,"request_announcements":17,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":5,"message_normalization":7,"client_creation":4,"request_build":12},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":42,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":79,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":195,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":122,"process_rss_mib_result":199,"process_anon_mib_result":118,"process_peak_rss_mib":202,"process_cpu_ms_turn":621,"process_wall_ms_turn":21546,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":75,"process_wall_ms_streaming":1160,"main_stream_count":3,"main_stream_event_count":127,"main_stream_chunk_count":14,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":75,"wall_ms":1160,"entries":3},"tool":{"cpu_ms":126,"wall_ms":9244,"entries":2},"first_event_wait":